{"repositoryId":1082132848,"availability":"available","full":"SeanRDC/Pixel-Clothing-Website","name":"Pixel-Clothing-Website","description":"Pixel Clothing Website is a stylish, responsive web storefront designed for a fictional fashion brand specializing in pixel-art-inspired apparel. Built with modern HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, the site features:","category":"Design","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2025-10-23T19:29:41Z","updated":"2026-10-15T09:08:12Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://pixel-clothing.vercel.app","topics":["css-animations","e-commerece","fullstack","fullstack-development","gamified-ui","mongobd","nextjs","pixel-art","react","retro-ui"],"demo":"https://pixel-clothing-website.vercel.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T11:21:03.497Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T11:21:03.497Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T11:21:03.497Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-15T11:21:03.497Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Retro MC reimagines the traditional e-commerce shopping experience as a classic 8-bit RPG adventure. Instead of scrolling through a standard grid of products, users enter a \"Merchant House,\" interact with the shopkeeper, and browse items through a gamified inventory UI. Built with Next.js and MongoDB, the application pairs robust full-stack architecture with a highly stylized, nostalgic frontend."],"features":["RPG Merchant Interaction: Users interact with a shopkeeper (\"EJ\") featuring dynamic, typewriter-effect dialogue that reacts to user browsing states.","Keeper's Inventory: A stylized UI where users \"equip\" clothing items to view their high-res pixel art, descriptions, and \"passive stats\" before adding them to their cart.","Code-Drawn Pixel Art: Wooden frames, parchment scrolls, icons, and the logo wordmark are drawn in code (9-slice SVG frames and grid-based SVG icons), so they stay crisp at any screen size and w